From 0885e000441c00cc32fd7a5f9a1466cb6fb20ed1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:50:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] feat: report number and html_url from write tools; expose
 review comment IDs

Create and update results for issues, pull requests and their comments
carry the issue or pull request number and the browser URL, so agents
no longer parse URLs or read the object back. A comment's number is
its issue or pull request.

pull_request_read get_review_comments now returns each comment's
numeric id, which is what add_reply_to_pull_request_comment takes as
commentId.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QV62ZkZa646Swi2zdbdnXN
